"Run self-test" = "Ejecutar autoprueba";
"Starts Mountpoint when you log in, so projects set to “Mount at app launch” are ready right away." = "Abre Mountpoint al iniciar sesión, para que los proyectos con «Montar al abrir la app» estén listos enseguida.";
"Switches the panel, the settings and the alerts between a light and a dark look." = "Cambia el panel, los ajustes y los avisos entre un aspecto claro y oscuro.";
"Settings…" = "Ajustes…";
"Hide Mountpoint" = "Ocultar Mountpoint";
"Quit Mountpoint" = "Salir de Mountpoint";
"Edit" = "Edición";
"Undo" = "Deshacer";
"Redo" = "Rehacer";
"Cut" = "Cortar";
"Copy" = "Copiar";
"Paste" = "Pegar";
"Select All" = "Seleccionar todo";
"Hide Settings" = "Ocultar Ajustes";
"Close Settings" = "Cerrar Ajustes";
"A self-test is already running – in Mountpoint or in the settings. Wait until it is done." = "Ya hay una autoprueba en curso, en Mountpoint o en los ajustes. Espera a que termine.";
"Show in Mountpoint" = "Mostrar en Mountpoint";
"Mountpoint did not answer, so launch at login was not changed. Open Mountpoint and try again." = "Mountpoint no ha respondido, así que el inicio al iniciar sesión no ha cambiado. Abre Mountpoint e inténtalo de nuevo.";
"The self-test is still running. The settings close by themselves when it is done." = "La autoprueba sigue en curso. Los ajustes se cerrarán solos cuando termine.";
"A self-test is running. Install the update when it is done." = "Hay una autoprueba en curso. Instala la actualización cuando termine.";
"Your workspace list could not be read and could not be set aside either. Mountpoint does not change it. Check the folder ~/Library/Application Support/Mountpoint." = "No se ha podido leer tu lista de workspaces ni apartarla. Mountpoint no la modifica. Revisa la carpeta ~/Library/Application Support/Mountpoint.";
"Your workspace list could not be read and was set aside as “%@” (in ~/Library/Application Support/Mountpoint). Mountpoint saved the list it had open." = "No se ha podido leer tu lista de workspaces y se ha apartado como «%@» (en ~/Library/Application Support/Mountpoint). Mountpoint ha guardado la lista que tenía abierta.";
"Your workspace list could not be read, so changes to protected volumes cannot be saved right now. Mountpoint repairs the list while it runs – open Mountpoint if it is not running. If this message stays, check the folder ~/Library/Application Support/Mountpoint." = "No se ha podido leer tu lista de workspaces, así que ahora no se pueden guardar cambios en los volúmenes protegidos. Mountpoint repara la lista mientras está abierto: abre Mountpoint si no lo está. Si este mensaje no desaparece, revisa la carpeta ~/Library/Application Support/Mountpoint.";
"Mountpoint could not be opened. Open it from the Applications folder." = "No se ha podido abrir Mountpoint. Ábrelo desde la carpeta Aplicaciones.";
"Soon this folder holds more than %@ files. We recommend starting a new folder now: quit Media Composer and rename this one, e.g. “1” to “1a”. The media stays online and Media Composer starts a new folder." = "Pronto esta carpeta tendrá más de %@ archivos. Recomendamos empezar ahora una carpeta nueva: cierra Media Composer y cambia el nombre de esta, p. ej. «1» a «1a». Los medios siguen en línea y Media Composer crea una carpeta nueva.";
"Like Mountpoint?" = "¿Te gusta Mountpoint?";
"Buy me a coffee" = "Invítame a un café";
"If you use Mountpoint and like it, I would be glad if you bought me a coffee." = "Si usas Mountpoint y te gusta, me alegraría que me invitaras a un café.";
"Move Mountpoint to the Applications folder" = "Mueve Mountpoint a la carpeta Aplicaciones";
"Mountpoint was opened from the disk image or a temporary place. Drag Mountpoint into the Applications folder and open it from there – otherwise it cannot update itself, and your volumes would disappear when the disk image is ejected." = "Mountpoint se abrió desde la imagen de disco o desde un lugar temporal. Arrastra Mountpoint a la carpeta Aplicaciones y ábrelo desde allí; si no, no puede actualizarse y tus volúmenes desaparecerían al expulsar la imagen de disco.";
"Finder sidebar cleanup" = "Limpieza de la barra lateral del Finder";
"Allow…" = "Permitir…";
"Remove old sidebar entries" = "Eliminar entradas antiguas";
"Use the same limit as in MediaFiles Check. A first warning comes above 90 %." = "Usa el mismo límite que en MediaFiles Check. Un primer aviso llega al superar el 90 %.";
"Keep the Finder sidebar tidy" = "Mantener ordenada la barra lateral del Finder";
"Ejected volumes stay in the Finder's sidebar list and come back when the Finder shows all external disks. A small helper, “Mountpoint Cleanup”, deletes Mountpoint's own old entries there at every start. It needs Full Disk Access for this." = "Los volúmenes expulsados se quedan en la lista de la barra lateral del Finder y vuelven cuando el Finder muestra todos los discos externos. Un pequeño ayudante, «Mountpoint Cleanup», borra allí las entradas antiguas de Mountpoint en cada inicio. Para ello necesita acceso total al disco.";
"In System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access, switch on “Mountpoint Cleanup”. Only this helper gets the access, and it changes nothing but this list." = "En Ajustes del Sistema → Privacidad y seguridad → Acceso total al disco, activa «Mountpoint Cleanup». Solo este ayudante recibe el acceso, y no cambia nada más que esta lista.";
"Mountpoint itself no longer needs Full Disk Access. Please switch it off for “Mountpoint” in the same list." = "Mountpoint ya no necesita acceso total al disco. Desactívalo para «Mountpoint» en la misma lista.";
"Full Disk Access is no longer needed" = "El acceso total al disco ya no es necesario";
"Open System Settings" = "Abrir Ajustes del Sistema";
